<TITLE>Interior Lamps</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>Various interior lights have been adopted to create a high-quality interior space with consideration for convenience and comfort.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>An illuminated entry system that illuminates according to the opening and closing of each door has been adopted for ease of use at night, and a large LED roof illumination and shift light have been provided on the G grade to enhance the interior space.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>White LEDs have been adopted for the front personal lights and room light on the G grade.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The vanity lights have been located on the roof side to be easy on the eyes.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
